1
00:00:32,365 --> 00:00:39,372
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:47,213 --> 00:00:49,215
<font color="white">Pi-o, let's make a promise.</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:53,720
<font color="white">Let's play some more four hands</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">even after the competition.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

4
00:00:53,803 --> 00:00:54,637
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:01:07,609 --> 00:01:10,320
<font color="white"><i>He left in the middle of the event,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>went to a practice room,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:01:10,403 --> 00:01:12,322
<font color="white"><i>and stared out the window</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>through the curtains.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:18,119 --> 00:01:19,746
<font color="white"><i>He seemed very flustered when I walked in.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:19,829 --> 00:01:20,663
<font color="white"><i>Could it be</i></font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:21,956 --> 00:01:23,374
<font color="white"><i>that his memory is back?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:01:33,635 --> 00:01:36,012
<font color="white"><i>Promise you won't sulk</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>if I win first place.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:01:36,095 --> 00:01:37,472
<font color="white"><i>Let's still have fun when we hang out.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:01:37,555 --> 00:01:39,140
<font color="white"><i>But I'm going to win first place.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:01:39,724 --> 00:01:40,600
<font color="white"><i>Don't get sulky yourself.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:58,159
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:01:59,410 --> 00:02:01,162
{\an8}<font color="white">EPISODE 10</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:44,205 --> 00:02:45,248
<font color="white">Can I come in?</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:53,882 --> 00:02:56,175
<font color="white">What brings you here at this hour?</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:58,887 --> 00:02:59,721
<font color="white">What is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:02,223
<font color="white">Do you have a question about the piece?</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:03:03,391 --> 00:03:04,225
<font color="white">Yeah.</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:05,226 --> 00:03:06,102
<font color="white">What is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:07,437 --> 00:03:09,063
<font color="white">Still struggling with the tempo?</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:09,606 --> 00:03:10,940
<font color="white">That piece.</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:11,774 --> 00:03:13,735
<font color="white">You said you started writing it</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">five years ago, right?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

25
00:03:14,861 --> 00:03:16,529
<font color="white">It took me five years to finish.</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:16,613 --> 00:03:17,655
<font color="white">Mr. Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:18,239 --> 00:03:20,199
<font color="white">Please be the first to play this.</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:22,368 --> 00:03:23,286
<font color="white">And your memory?</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:24,829 --> 00:03:26,873
<font color="white">You don't remember anything</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">after the accident?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

30
00:03:27,957 --> 00:03:28,791
<font color="white">That's right.</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:29,792 --> 00:03:30,877
<font color="white">Why do you ask?</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:32,003 --> 00:03:33,087
<font color="white">Is there a problem?</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:35,256 --> 00:03:37,842
<font color="white">What did you mean</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that I haven't changed at all?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

34
00:03:39,427 --> 00:03:42,805
<font color="white">Why haven't you changed at all, Mr. Kang?</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:42,889 --> 00:03:44,933
<font color="white">Haven't changed since when?</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:45,475 --> 00:03:46,559
<font color="white">Since high school?</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:47,602 --> 00:03:48,686
<font color="white">Or since Prague?</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:51,564
<font color="white">What are you trying to say?</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:03:51,648 --> 00:03:54,400
<font color="white">I'm asking how long you're planning</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to keep up the amnesia act.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

40
00:03:55,485 --> 00:03:58,404
<font color="white">I don't understand what you're saying.</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:00,949 --> 00:04:02,367
<font color="white">Then what about this?</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:03,451 --> 00:04:05,495
<font color="white">When I was in your dorm</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">back in high school,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

43
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,830
<font color="white">I saw a sketch you were working on.</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:07,914 --> 00:04:08,790
<font color="white"><i>But its subject</i></font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:09,791 --> 00:04:11,876
<font color="white">was the same as </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Nemesis</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

46
00:04:13,378 --> 00:04:14,212
<font color="white">Really?</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:14,796 --> 00:04:17,465
<font color="white">I composed something like that</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in high school?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

48
00:04:19,008 --> 00:04:20,218
<font color="white">I guess</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:20,301 --> 00:04:23,221
<font color="white">some mental images remain</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">even when you lose your memory.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

50
00:04:25,431 --> 00:04:26,266
<font color="white">Then…</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:28,226 --> 00:04:30,603
<font color="white">how do you remember the practice room</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">where we first met?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

52
00:04:32,063 --> 00:04:32,981
<font color="white">Tell me.</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:04:34,148 --> 00:04:35,275
<font color="white">Is that a coincidence as well?</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:04:39,696 --> 00:04:42,115
<font color="white">Stop pretending, Choi Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:04:45,285 --> 00:04:46,494
<font color="white">I know you remember everything.</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:04:51,708 --> 00:04:52,709
<font color="white">Fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:04:57,672 --> 00:04:58,673
<font color="white">To be honest…</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:00,842 --> 00:05:02,677
<font color="white">I've always wanted to visit</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:03,553 --> 00:05:05,680
<font color="white"><i>the practice room where we first met.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:07,515 --> 00:05:08,766
<font color="white"><i>We played </i></font><font color="white"><font color="white">Hungarian Dances…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

61
00:05:10,393 --> 00:05:11,394
<font color="white"><i>and </i></font><font color="white"><font color="white">Danse Macabre.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

62
00:05:12,603 --> 00:05:13,938
<font color="white"><i>And then the noise in the hallway.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:15,064 --> 00:05:16,858
<font color="white">CHOI JEONG-YO WILL WIN 1ST PLACE</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">NOT TRUE, KANG PI-O WILL!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

64
00:05:16,941 --> 00:05:18,943
<font color="white">I've never once forgotten any of it.</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:20,361 --> 00:05:21,279
<font color="white">Why did you do it?</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:24,198 --> 00:05:26,117
<font color="white">Why did you tell such a lie?</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,160
<font color="white">You know why.</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:05:29,329 --> 00:05:30,913
<font color="white">If I told you I remembered,</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:05:31,998 --> 00:05:34,042
<font color="white">you would've tried to kill me again.</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:05:37,879 --> 00:05:39,088
<font color="white">What are you talking about?</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:05:40,298 --> 00:05:41,966
<font color="white">I would've tried to kill you again?</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:05:42,050 --> 00:05:43,468
<font color="white">Don't play dumb.</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:05:44,427 --> 00:05:45,595
<font color="white">I know you're the one</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:05:46,512 --> 00:05:48,765
<font color="white">who ordered my abduction</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the competition nine years ago.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

75
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,017
<font color="white">Don't even try to trick me.</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:05:52,727 --> 00:05:55,897
<font color="white">I saw you meeting</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">one of my abductors with my own eyes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

77
00:05:57,356 --> 00:05:59,067
<font color="white">I couldn't believe it at first.</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:03,071 --> 00:06:05,823
<font color="white"><i>You were the friend I trusted</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and depended on the most.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:06,866 --> 00:06:09,368
<font color="white"><i>I never imagined you'd stoop so low.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:06:13,790 --> 00:06:14,916
<font color="white">Kang Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:06:14,999 --> 00:06:16,250
<font color="white">He gave the order.</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:06:16,751 --> 00:06:17,585
<font color="white"><i>But then</i></font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:06:18,086 --> 00:06:20,922
<font color="white"><i>I heard my abductor say your name.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:06:22,548 --> 00:06:25,051
<font color="white">Where's the nearest international bank?</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:06:25,593 --> 00:06:27,845
<font color="white">What? You want to come back here?</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:06:31,641 --> 00:06:34,435
<font color="white"><i>Then I saw you hand over money</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to another one.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:06:35,311 --> 00:06:37,480
<font color="white">I even went to your performances</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">several times.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

88
00:06:37,563 --> 00:06:38,648
<font color="white">But you…</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:06:39,899 --> 00:06:42,276
<font color="white"><i>You completely forgot I ever existed</i></font><font color="white"><font color="white">…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

90
00:06:44,904 --> 00:06:47,281
<font color="white"><i>and kept performing</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>like nothing ever happened.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:06:51,452 --> 00:06:53,246
<font color="white">So, how has it been?</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:06:55,123 --> 00:06:57,750
<font color="white">Did life feel easier</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with me out of the picture?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

93
00:06:58,876 --> 00:07:00,795
<font color="white">Did it feel good to perform</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:01,379 --> 00:07:02,338
<font color="white">as the winner?</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:15,268 --> 00:07:16,352
<font color="white">Why did you do that to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:07:18,771 --> 00:07:21,023
<font color="white">No, I won't go!</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:07:21,107 --> 00:07:22,400
<font color="white">I'd rather die</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:07:22,900 --> 00:07:24,735
<font color="white">than let anyone know about this.</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:07:24,819 --> 00:07:27,864
<font color="white">Are you willing to let me die like this?</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:07:42,628 --> 00:07:43,463
<font color="white">I'm sorry.</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:07:46,841 --> 00:07:47,717
<font color="white">You're right.</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:07:49,886 --> 00:07:51,095
<font color="white">It was me.</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:07:56,142 --> 00:07:58,519
<font color="white">It was the finals, and I hurt my finger.</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:07:58,603 --> 00:07:59,896
<font color="white">I couldn't think straight.</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:08:00,396 --> 00:08:02,607
<font color="white">I'd worked so hard to win the competition,</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:08:03,232 --> 00:08:05,193
<font color="white">but I was afraid I couldn't win</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">because of you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

107
00:08:06,194 --> 00:08:07,737
<font color="white">I'll turn myself in for what I did</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:08:08,905 --> 00:08:10,698
<font color="white">and face the consequences.</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:08:12,074 --> 00:08:13,367
<font color="white">I'll take responsibility</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:08:14,494 --> 00:08:15,828
<font color="white">for everything.</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:08:16,412 --> 00:08:17,705
<font color="white">"Responsibility"?</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:08:18,873 --> 00:08:21,292
<font color="white">You completely ruined my life.</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:08:21,918 --> 00:08:24,128
<font color="white">And you think</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sitting pretty in a cell will cut it?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

114
00:08:26,005 --> 00:08:29,175
<font color="white">I didn't struggle to come back alive</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">just to give you a free pass.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

115
00:08:29,842 --> 00:08:31,052
<font color="white">Listen.</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:08:33,262 --> 00:08:34,972
<font color="white">I'm the only one who gets to judge you.</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:08:36,182 --> 00:08:37,934
<font color="white">And I'm the only one who gets to kill you.</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:08:38,935 --> 00:08:40,645
<font color="white">If I just die, will this all end?</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:08:41,229 --> 00:08:42,063
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:08:43,648 --> 00:08:45,358
<font color="white">I won't let it end that easily.</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:08:48,486 --> 00:08:50,738
<font color="white">The second you take the easy way out,</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:08:50,821 --> 00:08:53,324
<font color="white">the whole world will know what you did.</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:08:53,407 --> 00:08:55,618
<font color="white">The same goes</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for your accomplice of a mother.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

124
00:08:58,412 --> 00:08:59,455
<font color="white">Just wait.</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:08:59,539 --> 00:09:01,082
<font color="white">I'll show you what hell looks like.</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:09:03,584 --> 00:09:06,337
<font color="white">It'll be more than</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you can possibly imagine.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

127
00:09:16,931 --> 00:09:19,433
<font color="white">MUSICAL INSTRUMENT ARCADE</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">TRADITIONAL MARKET</font><font color="white"></font></font>

128
00:09:29,944 --> 00:09:31,320
<font color="white">Hello.</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:09:31,404 --> 00:09:34,156
<font color="white">Can I ask you a question?</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,408
<font color="white">By any chance,</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,910
<font color="white">do you know who this is?</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:09:37,994 --> 00:09:40,329
<font color="white">He's Conductor Choi Jeong-yo,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and I hear he grew up here.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

133
00:09:40,413 --> 00:09:42,999
<font color="white">I think I've heard of him.</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:09:43,082 --> 00:09:46,961
<font color="white">Then do you know</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">where Jeong-yo's father is?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

135
00:09:48,004 --> 00:09:48,838
<font color="white">I'm not sure.</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:09:50,881 --> 00:09:51,841
<font color="white">Thank you anyway.</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:10:10,067 --> 00:10:11,068
<font color="white">Excuse me.</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:11,944 --> 00:10:13,863
<font color="white">Have you heard of Conductor Choi Jeong-yo?</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:10:15,031 --> 00:10:18,075
<font color="white">I heard his father</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">used to work around here.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

140
00:10:19,952 --> 00:10:20,953
<font color="white">It's hard to say.</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:10:22,079 --> 00:10:24,248
<font color="white">He does look familiar,</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:10:25,625 --> 00:10:28,085
<font color="white">but I could be wrong. I'm not sure.</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:10:29,587 --> 00:10:30,546
<font color="white">I don't know.</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:10:38,554 --> 00:10:39,430
<font color="white">Excuse me.</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:10:42,350 --> 00:10:43,643
<font color="white">Are you looking for Choi Gi-taek?</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:10:53,319 --> 00:10:54,153
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:10:54,779 --> 00:10:55,613
<font color="white">May I ask your name?</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:10:55,696 --> 00:10:57,406
<font color="white">Just call me Kim.</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:10:58,491 --> 00:10:59,325
<font color="white">And you?</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:11:00,868 --> 00:11:01,744
<font color="white">Well,</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:02,662 --> 00:11:04,288
<font color="white">I'm Jeong-yo's friend's mother.</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:11:04,789 --> 00:11:06,457
<font color="white">I don't know if you've seen the news,</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:11:06,540 --> 00:11:08,459
<font color="white">but Jeong-yo lost his memory.</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:09,210 --> 00:11:12,713
<font color="white">I'm looking for his family,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">hoping it might help him.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

155
00:11:12,797 --> 00:11:13,839
<font color="white">I see.</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,258
<font color="white">So you're trying to help?</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:11:18,469 --> 00:11:19,595
<font color="white">So…</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:11:21,222 --> 00:11:22,890
<font color="white">how do you know Jeong-yo?</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:11:23,516 --> 00:11:25,017
<font color="white">I'm a close friend of his.</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:11:26,102 --> 00:11:27,019
<font color="white">Right.</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:11:27,728 --> 00:11:29,438
<font color="white">I see.</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:11:30,064 --> 00:11:31,273
<font color="white">Then do you know</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:11:32,066 --> 00:11:33,943
<font color="white">where Jeong-yo's father is?</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:11:34,693 --> 00:11:36,153
<font color="white">The bastard who took off with my money?</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:11:36,904 --> 00:11:38,697
<font color="white">I guess I could find him if I wanted to,</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:11:38,781 --> 00:11:40,950
<font color="white">but he's probably</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">passed out drunk somewhere.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

167
00:11:48,457 --> 00:11:51,961
<font color="white">ALCOHOL REHAB CENTER</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:11:55,673 --> 00:11:56,632
<font color="white">Oh, I…</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:11:58,217 --> 00:12:01,554
<font color="white">I guess you don't know where he is either.</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:12:02,304 --> 00:12:04,098
<font color="white">Thank you for your time.</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:12:04,682 --> 00:12:05,808
<font color="white">If you'll excuse me.</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:12:18,988 --> 00:12:20,990
<font color="white">You're Pianist Kang Pi-o's mother, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:12:21,824 --> 00:12:22,992
<font color="white">I saw the news then.</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:12:24,452 --> 00:12:27,329
<font color="white">Jeong-yo went missing,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and Kang Pi-o won first place.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

175
00:12:28,414 --> 00:12:29,331
<font color="white">But you know,</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:12:29,832 --> 00:12:32,084
<font color="white">word will get out</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">if you poke around like this.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

177
00:12:38,007 --> 00:12:39,508
<font color="white">Call me if you need any help.</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:12:53,147 --> 00:12:54,231
<font color="white">Please pick up.</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:12:56,901 --> 00:12:57,860
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:12:57,943 --> 00:12:58,777
<font color="white"><i>Yes?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:12:59,278 --> 00:13:00,279
<font color="white">What are we going to do?</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:13:01,947 --> 00:13:02,823
<font color="white">Choi Jeong-yo</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:13:04,116 --> 00:13:05,784
<font color="white">doesn't have amnesia.</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:13:06,744 --> 00:13:08,829
<font color="white"><i>His father is an alcoholic.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:13:08,913 --> 00:13:10,956
<font color="white"><i>He was at that alcohol rehab center.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:13:12,041 --> 00:13:12,875
<font color="white">He…</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:13:13,834 --> 00:13:16,504
<font color="white">He's trying to get revenge on us.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">What should we do?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

188
00:13:17,588 --> 00:13:19,173
<font color="white">He'll expose us if we do nothing.</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:13:20,591 --> 00:13:22,551
<font color="white"><i>We need to stop him somehow.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:13:22,635 --> 00:13:24,428
<font color="white">We have to, no matter what!</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:13:24,929 --> 00:13:25,971
<font color="white"><i>How would we do that?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:13:26,889 --> 00:13:28,057
<font color="white">We committed a crime,</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:13:28,974 --> 00:13:30,643
<font color="white">and he'd only be telling the truth.</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:13:31,268 --> 00:13:33,687
<font color="white">We need to get rid of him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so he can't talk.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

195
00:13:33,771 --> 00:13:35,189
<font color="white">What are you saying?</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:13:35,272 --> 00:13:37,316
<font color="white">We have no choice if we want to survive!</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:13:37,399 --> 00:13:38,901
<font color="white">Just stop it!</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:13:39,944 --> 00:13:41,987
<font color="white">If you go after Jeong-yo again…</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:13:43,989 --> 00:13:45,866
<font color="white">I swear I won't just stand by.</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:13:45,950 --> 00:13:46,909
<font color="white"><i>Have you lost your mind?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:49,119
<font color="white">Don't you understand?</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:13:49,912 --> 00:13:52,998
<font color="white">He came back to get revenge on us!</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:13:53,082 --> 00:13:54,583
<font color="white">Then I'll let him…</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:13:56,085 --> 00:13:57,378
<font color="white">take out his revenge on me.</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:13:57,461 --> 00:13:58,295
<font color="white"><i>Pi-o!</i></font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:08,180
<font color="white">This contract contains</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">too many toxic clauses for our soloist.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

207
00:14:08,764 --> 00:14:10,599
<font color="white">Under these terms,</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:14:10,683 --> 00:14:13,644
<font color="white">he will have to take on too much risk</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">if the project falls through.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

209
00:14:14,228 --> 00:14:17,606
<font color="white">We're also taking a risk</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">by signing this contract.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

210
00:14:17,690 --> 00:14:21,527
<font color="white">Recording a world premiere is different</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from recording standard repertoire.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

211
00:14:22,152 --> 00:14:24,905
<font color="white">Still, this is too much.</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:14:26,031 --> 00:14:28,033
<font color="white">This soloist replacement clause is--</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:14:28,117 --> 00:14:29,410
<font color="white">I'm sure you know</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:14:29,493 --> 00:14:32,872
<font color="white">that's just a safeguard</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">against a worst-case scenario.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

215
00:14:32,955 --> 00:14:35,291
<font color="white">If the recording gets delayed</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">because of the soloist,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

216
00:14:35,833 --> 00:14:37,543
<font color="white">it will disrupt the schedules</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:14:37,626 --> 00:14:39,753
<font color="white">for the orchestra and the engineers.</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:14:39,837 --> 00:14:41,297
<font color="white">We're just trying to minimize the damage.</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:14:42,131 --> 00:14:43,132
<font color="white">To be honest,</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:14:44,049 --> 00:14:45,926
<font color="white">our partners overseas</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:49,263
<font color="white">have expressed their concerns</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">about Mr. Kang…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

222
00:14:51,557 --> 00:14:53,684
<font color="white">We understand your position.</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:14:53,767 --> 00:14:56,645
<font color="white">We'll discuss this further internally.</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:15:11,535 --> 00:15:12,828
<font color="white">Why did you do that?</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:15:13,495 --> 00:15:15,581
<font color="white">You should've had them</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">remove the toxic clauses first.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

226
00:15:15,664 --> 00:15:16,540
<font color="white">What's the rush?</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:15:18,250 --> 00:15:21,170
<font color="white">Don't worry.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">It'll be fine if I just play well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

228
00:15:21,837 --> 00:15:23,255
<font color="white">There's no time.</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:15:25,591 --> 00:15:27,009
<font color="white">Once the schedule is set,</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:15:27,092 --> 00:15:29,261
<font color="white">I'll send you a list of </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>tonmeisters</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

231
00:15:29,887 --> 00:15:33,223
<font color="white">We definitely plan to book Dominic</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">since he's the best in the industry,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

232
00:15:33,307 --> 00:15:34,975
<font color="white">but in case he's unavailable,</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:15:35,601 --> 00:15:38,729
<font color="white">I'll have a backup list ready.</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:15:39,563 --> 00:15:40,773
<font color="white">Well done.</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:15:41,899 --> 00:15:44,985
<font color="white">Now that the contract is signed,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'm feeling nervous.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

236
00:15:45,861 --> 00:15:48,405
<font color="white">On that note, let's increase</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">your individual practice time.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

237
00:15:49,281 --> 00:15:51,784
<font color="white">The orchestra is coming together,</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:15:52,534 --> 00:15:54,662
<font color="white">but I'm worried about the solo part.</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:15:56,622 --> 00:15:57,581
<font color="white">What do you say?</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:15:58,832 --> 00:16:00,000
<font color="white">Can you make some time?</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:16:00,918 --> 00:16:02,044
<font color="white">I will.</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:05,005
<font color="white">We need to work on the details,</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:16:05,673 --> 00:16:07,549
<font color="white">so come alone without the accompanist.</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:16:10,302 --> 00:16:11,220
<font color="white">I'm counting on you.</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:16:28,070 --> 00:16:29,029
<font color="white">So…</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:16:30,364 --> 00:16:31,657
<font color="white">what's going to happen to us?</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:16:34,368 --> 00:16:37,246
<font color="white">Do we just wait until our lives are over?</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:16:37,830 --> 00:16:39,456
<font color="white">I'll do whatever I can,</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:16:41,583 --> 00:16:42,793
<font color="white">so don't worry.</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:17:05,190 --> 00:17:06,025
<font color="white">Come in.</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:17:26,003 --> 00:17:27,171
<font color="white">Wait.</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:17:29,131 --> 00:17:30,340
<font color="white">At this tempo.</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:17:30,966 --> 00:17:32,009
<font color="white">But why?</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:17:33,052 --> 00:17:36,263
<font color="white">The opening should focus on</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">evoking an emotional response,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

255
00:17:36,847 --> 00:17:38,557
<font color="white">not the speed.</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:17:40,517 --> 00:17:42,686
<font color="white">You think your opinion matters right now?</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:17:43,687 --> 00:17:46,940
<font color="white">I have a specific sound and tempo in mind.</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:17:47,566 --> 00:17:50,152
<font color="white">But you completely lack the power</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to express that.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

259
00:17:50,235 --> 00:17:51,320
<font color="white">I want this piece</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:17:51,987 --> 00:17:54,573
<font color="white">to erupt with explosive cohesion.</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:17:55,532 --> 00:17:58,118
<font color="white">I don't want a weak and limp delivery.</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:17:58,202 --> 00:17:59,036
<font color="white">Understand?</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:52,339
<font color="white">Again.</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:18:53,465 --> 00:18:54,883
<font color="white">Play the cadenza at this tempo.</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:18:55,634 --> 00:18:57,386
<font color="white">What are you trying to pull here?</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:18:58,095 --> 00:18:58,929
<font color="white">What is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:18:59,012 --> 00:19:01,181
<font color="white">Trying to ruin my tendons</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so I can't play anymore?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

268
00:19:01,849 --> 00:19:03,725
<font color="white">Is this the revenge</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you told me to wait for?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

269
00:19:03,809 --> 00:19:05,686
<font color="white">Do you still not get it?</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:19:09,022 --> 00:19:11,692
<font color="white">You've got this all wrong.</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:19:14,319 --> 00:19:16,280
<font color="white">I didn't give you my precious music</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:19:16,363 --> 00:19:18,574
<font color="white">to waste on some petty scheme.</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:19:23,954 --> 00:19:26,248
<font color="white">I had a gun aimed at my head.</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:19:31,628 --> 00:19:34,381
<font color="white"><i>The car drove deep into a forest.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:19:34,464 --> 00:19:36,341
<font color="white"><i>It was obvious what they were up to.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:19:36,425 --> 00:19:40,262
<font color="white"><i>To take me somewhere isolated</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and kill me without anyone knowing.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:19:40,345 --> 00:19:43,307
<font color="white">Watch it before you drive us into a grave.</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:19:43,390 --> 00:19:44,308
<font color="white">No, you watch it.</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:19:44,391 --> 00:19:46,185
<font color="white">Don't get blood splatter in the car.</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:19:46,977 --> 00:19:50,063
<font color="white"><i>Then I saw an opening to get out alive.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:19:50,147 --> 00:19:52,107
<font color="white"><i>They started fighting.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

282
00:19:52,608 --> 00:19:55,777
<font color="white"><i>I saw that as my chance</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and fought for my life to get away.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:19:58,155 --> 00:19:58,989
<font color="white"><i>I thought I'd made it.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:19:59,990 --> 00:20:00,991
<font color="white"><i>I thought I was free.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:20:01,658 --> 00:20:02,868
<font color="white"><i>But I was wrong.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:20:03,535 --> 00:20:04,536
<font color="white"><i>Just then,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:20:06,163 --> 00:20:09,708
<font color="white"><i>I heard a bullet</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>rip through my right shoulder.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

288
00:20:16,924 --> 00:20:18,050
<font color="white">The shock of it…</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:20:20,219 --> 00:20:21,803
<font color="white">left me with no memory for five years…</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:20:23,555 --> 00:20:24,806
<font color="white">until I saw you again.</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:20:26,642 --> 00:20:27,851
<font color="white">That very moment.</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:20:29,603 --> 00:20:32,397
<font color="white">I wrote that hellish moment</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">into the cadenza.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

293
00:20:33,523 --> 00:20:34,733
<font color="white">So do you really think</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:20:35,984 --> 00:20:39,196
<font color="white">you're delivering that overwhelming fear</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in your performance?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

295
00:20:41,281 --> 00:20:42,699
<font color="white">Don't kid yourself.</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:20:44,034 --> 00:20:45,953
<font color="white">I'm not doing this to screw you over.</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:20:46,620 --> 00:20:49,081
<font color="white">Making </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Nemesis</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"> into a masterpiece</font><font color="white"></font></font>

298
00:20:49,164 --> 00:20:50,916
<font color="white">matters more to me than to you.</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:20:50,999 --> 00:20:52,000
<font color="white">So…</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:20:53,794 --> 00:20:56,171
<font color="white">instead of worrying about</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">pulling a stupid tendon…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

301
00:20:58,548 --> 00:21:02,302
<font color="white">think about whether you're capturing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the vision of the composer.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

302
00:21:03,679 --> 00:21:07,099
<font color="white">You expect me to forgive you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with that kind of complacent attitude?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

303
00:21:28,996 --> 00:21:30,205
<font color="white">Fourth and fifth fingers are weak.</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:21:32,332 --> 00:21:33,917
<font color="white">With more clarity!</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:22:52,579 --> 00:22:54,331
<font color="white">I have to keep going.</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:23:19,564 --> 00:23:21,733
<font color="white"><i>You failed to satisfy me today.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:23:22,943 --> 00:23:25,987
<font color="white"><i>The cadenza isn't as murderous</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and hostile as it should be.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:23:50,762 --> 00:23:53,765
<font color="white">How is the schedule for the concert hall?</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:23:54,683 --> 00:23:57,978
<font color="white">I checked,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and the venue was fully booked,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

310
00:23:58,061 --> 00:23:59,521
<font color="white">but I managed to secure a day.</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:24:00,272 --> 00:24:02,023
<font color="white">Will a day be enough?</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:24:02,107 --> 00:24:04,484
<font color="white">I'm afraid the schedule will be too tight.</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:24:04,568 --> 00:24:08,989
<font color="white">Jeong-yo is working tirelessly with Pi-o</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and the orchestra in separate rehearsals,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

314
00:24:09,072 --> 00:24:11,491
<font color="white">so doing it all in one day</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">shouldn't be a problem.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

315
00:24:11,575 --> 00:24:13,451
<font color="white">We can record the movements</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">separately that day,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

316
00:24:13,535 --> 00:24:14,995
<font color="white">so it should be fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:24:15,579 --> 00:24:16,621
<font color="white">Separate rehearsals?</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:24:16,705 --> 00:24:17,706
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:24:18,290 --> 00:24:20,333
<font color="white">But why separate rehearsals?</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:24:20,417 --> 00:24:21,251
<font color="white">I don't know.</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:24:22,586 --> 00:24:24,880
<font color="white">Jeong-yo says it's too early</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to bring them together.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

322
00:24:25,505 --> 00:24:26,923
<font color="white">He's been fine-tuning them separately.</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:24:27,966 --> 00:24:30,177
<font color="white"><i>I'm sure the composer knows</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>what he's doing.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:24:33,513 --> 00:24:36,183
<font color="white">Why are you letting mere finger pain</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dull your playing?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

325
00:24:43,023 --> 00:24:45,150
<font color="white">Don't make a fuss and focus until the end!</font><font color="white"></font>

326
