<font color="white">Hey.</font><font color="white"></font>

493
00:41:00,791 --> 00:41:02,626
<font color="white">This was your plan all along, wasn't it?</font><font color="white"></font>

494
00:41:02,710 --> 00:41:05,796
<font color="white">Go ahead and expose me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">instead of toying with me like this.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

495
00:41:06,464 --> 00:41:08,591
<font color="white">I'll take whatever punishment</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and get out of your sight.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

496
00:41:08,674 --> 00:41:11,051
<font color="white">So just expose me, you bastard!</font><font color="white"></font>

497
00:41:12,595 --> 00:41:15,097
<font color="white">You didn't know I'd do this?</font><font color="white"></font>

498
00:41:15,806 --> 00:41:17,183
<font color="white">I told you.</font><font color="white"></font>

499
00:41:17,766 --> 00:41:20,227
<font color="white">I'm going to make you feel</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">every bit of pain, rage, and betrayal</font><font color="white"></font></font>

500
00:41:21,312 --> 00:41:22,855
<font color="white">that I went through.</font><font color="white"></font>

501
00:41:28,360 --> 00:41:29,195
<font color="white">But you know,</font><font color="white"></font>

502
00:41:29,945 --> 00:41:32,740
<font color="white">I'm a little disappointed in you,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kang Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

503
00:41:33,949 --> 00:41:37,369
<font color="white">I was curious to see</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">if you could push past this limit.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

504
00:41:38,579 --> 00:41:39,413
<font color="white">And to be honest…</font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:41:40,831 --> 00:41:42,124
<font color="white">I was hoping you would.</font><font color="white"></font>

506
00:41:48,088 --> 00:41:49,006
<font color="white">This just proves</font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:41:49,840 --> 00:41:52,384
<font color="white">you're nothing but a pathetic loser</font><font color="white"></font>

508
00:41:52,468 --> 00:41:55,262
<font color="white">who should've never pursued music</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in the first place.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

509
00:41:56,138 --> 00:41:59,892
<font color="white">Jealous bastards like you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">destroy real geniuses.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

510
00:42:06,315 --> 00:42:08,025
<font color="white">How dare a mediocre pianist like you</font><font color="white"></font>

511
00:42:09,109 --> 00:42:12,404
<font color="white">try to cheat your way to the top</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">by killing me?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

512
00:42:14,782 --> 00:42:15,699
<font color="white">Hey.</font><font color="white"></font>

513
00:42:21,080 --> 00:42:22,581
<font color="white">You'll never beat me.</font><font color="white"></font>

514
00:42:33,008 --> 00:42:33,842
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

515
00:42:34,593 --> 00:42:35,553
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

516
00:42:36,512 --> 00:42:39,181
<font color="white">Give me the key right now.</font><font color="white"></font>

517
