518
00:42:50,442 --> 00:42:51,402
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

519
00:43:05,332 --> 00:43:07,501
<font color="white">Why didn't you listen to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

520
00:43:11,714 --> 00:43:12,965
<font color="white">Look at your hands.</font><font color="white"></font>

521
00:43:16,719 --> 00:43:18,262
<font color="white">I'm sorry.</font><font color="white"></font>

522
00:43:18,345 --> 00:43:22,016
<font color="white">I tried to communicate my vision</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as the composer to Pianist Kang Pi-o,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

523
00:43:22,099 --> 00:43:23,183
<font color="white">but it proved rather difficult.</font><font color="white"></font>

524
00:43:23,684 --> 00:43:26,228
<font color="white">I should've altered course earlier, but…</font><font color="white"></font>

525
00:43:27,187 --> 00:43:28,439
<font color="white">This is all on me.</font><font color="white"></font>

526
00:43:28,522 --> 00:43:29,440
<font color="white">I'm not sure.</font><font color="white"></font>

527
00:43:30,649 --> 00:43:31,775
<font color="white">Was Kang Pi-o</font><font color="white"></font>

528
00:43:32,401 --> 00:43:34,528
<font color="white">the real problem here?</font><font color="white"></font>

529
00:43:34,612 --> 00:43:35,654
<font color="white">The way I see it,</font><font color="white"></font>

530
00:43:36,322 --> 00:43:40,826
<font color="white">the issue was your poor communication</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">rattling the soloist.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

531
00:43:41,910 --> 00:43:45,122
<font color="white">The rehearsals were unnecessarily brutal,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and you put him through verbal abuse.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

532
00:43:45,623 --> 00:43:47,541
<font color="white">That's why he lost his nerve</font><font color="white"></font>

533
00:43:47,625 --> 00:43:49,126
<font color="white">and broke down.</font><font color="white"></font>

534
00:43:49,209 --> 00:43:50,794
<font color="white">Hong Jae-in, stop right now.</font><font color="white"></font>

535
00:43:52,880 --> 00:43:55,007
