<font color="white">to master the piece.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

536
00:43:55,090 --> 00:43:56,967
<font color="white">Don't blame the composer.</font><font color="white"></font>

537
00:43:57,051 --> 00:43:57,968
<font color="white">Ms. Han.</font><font color="white"></font>

538
00:43:59,887 --> 00:44:03,307
<font color="white">This means Pi-o</font><font color="white">
