541
00:44:09,396 --> 00:44:10,481
<font color="white">That's not true.</font><font color="white"></font>

542
00:44:11,398 --> 00:44:13,734
<font color="white">He played really well from where I stood.</font><font color="white"></font>

543
00:44:15,527 --> 00:44:16,737
<font color="white">Whatever the case,</font><font color="white"></font>

544
00:44:18,113 --> 00:44:19,156
<font color="white">Pi-o is the one</font><font color="white"></font>

