00:44:27,623 --> 00:44:29,124
<font color="white">that alone</font><font color="white"></font>

548
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:30,959
<font color="white">means he's not qualified.</font><font color="white"></font>

549
00:44:32,461 --> 00:44:35,798
<font color="white">The 80th anniversary concert</font><font color="white">
