<font color="white">so I kept someone in mind as a backup.</font><font color="white"></font>

554
00:44:46,183 --> 00:44:48,310
<font color="white">How do you feel about</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Pianist Lee Min-sung?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

555
00:44:49,269 --> 00:44:50,521
<font color="white">Lee Min-sung…</font><font color="white"></font>

556
00:44:52,231 --> 00:44:54,650
<font color="white">Lee Min-sung…</font><font color="white"></font>

557
00:44:58,654 --> 00:45:00,239
<font color="white">JAE-IN</font><font color="white"></font>

558
00:45:04,368 --> 00:45:06,078
<font color="white">KANG PI-O REPLACED BY PIANIST LEE MIN-SUNG</font><font color="white"></font>

559
00:45:13,085 --> 00:45:14,253
<font color="white">KANG PI-O REPLACED BY PIANIST LEE MIN-SUNG</font><font color="white"></font>

560
00:45:14,336 --> 00:45:15,671
<font color="white">KANG HAD DIFFICULTY DURING REHEARSAL…</font><font color="white"></font>

561
00:45:25,389 --> 00:45:27,015
<font color="white">I'm sorry, Mr. Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

562
00:45:27,099 --> 00:45:31,186
<font color="white">As you warned me, Pianist Kang Pi-o</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">wasn't the right fit for this piece.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

563
00:45:31,687 --> 00:45:33,564
<font color="white">But I was being stubborn.</font><font color="white"></font>

564
00:45:33,647 --> 00:45:35,482
<font color="white">I apologize for the worry I've caused.</font><font color="white"></font>

565
00:45:37,359 --> 00:45:39,862
<font color="white">If that's what the composer says,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I guess that's how it is.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

566
00:45:40,696 --> 00:45:41,613
<font color="white">However,</font><font color="white"></font>

567
00:45:42,197 --> 00:45:45,534
<font color="white">do you remember</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">what I said about that piece?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

568
00:45:46,869 --> 00:45:51,415
<font color="white">I hoped it would be performed</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as music that speaks to everyone.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

569
00:45:52,458 --> 00:45:54,293
<font color="white">Did you try to make that happen?</font><font color="white"></font>

570
00:45:56,170 --> 00:45:57,337
<font color="white">You see,</font><font color="white"></font>

571
00:45:58,088 --> 00:46:01,967
<font color="white">I get the sense</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that your intentions weren't so pure.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

572
00:46:02,551 --> 00:46:03,886
<font color="white">Why is that?</font><font color="white"></font>

573
00:46:03,969 --> 00:46:04,970
<font color="white">I'm not sure.</font><font color="white"></font>

574
00:46:07,639 --> 00:46:10,476
<font color="white">I only wrote the best piece I could.</font><font color="white"></font>

575
00:46:18,650 --> 00:46:19,651
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

576
00:46:22,446 --> 00:46:25,616
<font color="white">I'm sorry for dropping by unannounced.</font><font color="white"></font>

577
00:46:28,702 --> 00:46:31,788
<font color="white">But I'm just so frustrated.</font><font color="white"></font>

578
00:46:32,706 --> 00:46:34,333
<font color="white">And I have no one to talk to.</font><font color="white"></font>

579
00:46:35,459 --> 00:46:37,419
<font color="white">Don't worry about it. It's okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

580
00:46:37,503 --> 00:46:39,296
<font color="white">Go ahead and tell me everything.</font><font color="white"></font>

581
00:46:41,507 --> 00:46:42,424
<font color="white">I'm sure</font><font color="white"></font>

582
00:46:43,550 --> 00:46:45,469
<font color="white">something happened between them.</font><font color="white"></font>

583
00:46:46,386 --> 00:46:47,262
<font color="white">I saw Jeong-yo</font><font color="white"></font>

584
00:46:47,971 --> 00:46:50,390
<font color="white">deliberately being brutal to Pi-o</font><font color="white"></font>

585
00:46:51,433 --> 00:46:53,352
<font color="white">with my own eyes.</font><font color="white"></font>

586
00:46:54,186 --> 00:46:56,730
<font color="white">And Pi-o is keeping his mouth shut</font><font color="white"></font>

587
00:46:57,314 --> 00:46:58,649
<font color="white">for whatever reason.</font><font color="white"></font>

588
00:46:59,233 --> 00:47:02,236
<font color="white">Since Jeong-yo is the conductor</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and the composer,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

589
00:47:02,319 --> 00:47:07,241
<font color="white">-it's natural for him to get ambitious--</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-I understand that much.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

590
00:47:08,492 --> 00:47:11,119
<font color="white">But it all feels very personal.</font><font color="white"></font>

591
00:47:14,456 --> 00:47:15,332
<font color="white">It's like…</font><font color="white"></font>

592
00:47:17,793 --> 00:47:20,170
<font color="white">he's determined to bring Pi-o down.</font><font color="white"></font>

593
00:47:24,466 --> 00:47:26,301
<font color="white">Please save Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

594
00:47:28,053 --> 00:47:30,806
<font color="white">Please get Choi Jeong-yo away from Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

595
00:47:30,889 --> 00:47:32,307
<font color="white">I'm so scared.</font><font color="white"></font>

596
00:47:33,642 --> 00:47:35,352
<font color="white">I'm scared to death.</font><font color="white"></font>

597
00:47:44,486 --> 00:47:46,029
<font color="white">Call me if you need any help.</font><font color="white"></font>

598
00:47:52,119 --> 00:47:54,454
<font color="white">PERSONAL CONSULTING SERVICES</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">KIM SE-JIN</font><font color="white"></font></font>

599
00:47:56,915 --> 00:47:58,375
<font color="white">HYUN-SOO</font><font color="white"></font>

600
00:48:03,797 --> 00:48:04,840
<font color="white">Hello?</font><font color="white"></font>

601
00:48:04,923 --> 00:48:06,883
<font color="white"><i>Where are you right now? Let's talk.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

602
00:48:06,967 --> 00:48:08,385
<font color="white">I'm busy. Can we do this later--</font><font color="white"></font>

603
00:48:08,468 --> 00:48:10,470
<font color="white"><i>This concerns Pi-o. We need to talk.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

604
00:48:20,272 --> 00:48:21,273
<font color="white">What's this about?</font><font color="white"></font>

605
00:48:22,441 --> 00:48:24,735
<font color="white">Is it about Pi-o being removed</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from the concerto?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

606
00:48:25,861 --> 00:48:27,779
<font color="white">Choi Jeong-yo was playing games with him.</font><font color="white"></font>

607
00:48:28,572 --> 00:48:30,073
<font color="white">And Pi-o fell for it.</font><font color="white"></font>

608
00:48:31,033 --> 00:48:31,867
<font color="white">Why?</font><font color="white"></font>

609
00:48:35,162 --> 00:48:37,539
<font color="white">Why would Jeong-yo play games with Pi-o?</font><font color="white"></font>

610
00:48:39,082 --> 00:48:39,958
<font color="white">I don't know.</font><font color="white"></font>

611
00:48:41,460 --> 00:48:45,339
<font color="white">He probably thought Pi-o's life</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">was all roses while he was missing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

612
00:48:45,422 --> 00:48:49,468
<font color="white">Jealousy of sorts, perhaps?</font><font color="white"></font>

613
00:48:49,551 --> 00:48:51,762
<font color="white">You know that's not what it is, Ji-hye.</font><font color="white"></font>

614
00:48:51,845 --> 00:48:54,139
<font color="white">Come on, you know it's not!</font><font color="white"></font>

615
00:48:56,850 --> 00:49:00,979
<font color="white">Please just tell me the truth</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">about what happened back then.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

616
00:49:01,063 --> 00:49:03,482
<font color="white">That nasty rumor that went around.</font><font color="white"></font>

617
00:49:03,565 --> 00:49:06,735
<font color="white">The one about Pi-o being involved</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in Jeong-yo's disappearance.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

618
00:49:06,818 --> 00:49:08,528
<font color="white">Was that actually true?</font><font color="white"></font>

619
00:49:09,696 --> 00:49:10,739
<font color="white">How could you say that?</font><font color="white"></font>

620
00:49:13,408 --> 00:49:14,242
<font color="white">It's not true.</font><font color="white"></font>

621
00:49:18,080 --> 00:49:20,332
<font color="white">How could you believe</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a ridiculous rumor like that?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

622
00:49:23,043 --> 00:49:24,086
<font color="white">I'm leaving.</font><font color="white"></font>

623
00:49:25,671 --> 00:49:27,589
<font color="white">Then what did you mean before?</font><font color="white"></font>

624
00:49:28,548 --> 00:49:31,385
<font color="white">You asked me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to get Jeong-yo away from Pi-o!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

625
00:49:31,968 --> 00:49:33,553
<font color="white">You said you were scared to death!</font><font color="white"></font>

626
00:49:33,637 --> 00:49:35,555
<font color="white">What the hell did you mean by that?</font><font color="white"></font>

627
00:49:44,272 --> 00:49:45,190
<font color="white"><i>This just proves</i></font><font color="white"></font>

628
00:49:45,941 --> 00:49:47,984
<font color="white"><i>you're nothing but a pathetic loser</i></font><font color="white"></font>

629
00:49:48,652 --> 00:49:51,363
<font color="white"><i>who should've never pursued music</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>in the first place.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

630
00:49:52,906 --> 00:49:56,451
<font color="white"><i>Jealous bastards like you</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>destroy real geniuses.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

631
00:50:04,167 --> 00:50:05,001
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

632
00:50:07,879 --> 00:50:09,798
<font color="white">Pi-o didn't do anything.</font><font color="white"></font>

633
00:50:09,881 --> 00:50:10,716
<font color="white">Pi-o…</font><font color="white"></font>

634
00:50:12,426 --> 00:50:13,552
<font color="white">He's innocent.</font><font color="white"></font>

635
00:50:14,594 --> 00:50:15,512
<font color="white">It was all me…</font><font color="white"></font>

636
00:50:17,556 --> 00:50:18,515
<font color="white">It was me.</font><font color="white"></font>

637
00:50:20,559 --> 00:50:21,768
<font color="white">I did it.</font><font color="white"></font>

638
00:50:24,521 --> 00:50:25,564
<font color="white">I…</font><font color="white"></font>

639
00:50:27,899 --> 00:50:29,276
<font color="white">I did it.</font><font color="white"></font>

640
00:52:14,089 --> 00:52:15,298
<font color="white">Grandfather.</font><font color="white"></font>

641
00:52:16,591 --> 00:52:17,801
<font color="white">Is it agonizing?</font><font color="white"></font>

642
00:52:29,938 --> 00:52:32,023
<font color="white">That's the nature of art.</font><font color="white"></font>

643
00:52:35,318 --> 00:52:37,737
<font color="white">It'd be easier to reach for the stars.</font><font color="white"></font>

644
00:52:39,322 --> 00:52:41,283
<font color="white">Art is like a mirage.</font><font color="white"></font>

645
00:52:42,033 --> 00:52:44,828
<font color="white">You chase it down,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">only for it to move farther away.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

646
00:52:44,911 --> 00:52:47,747
<font color="white">When you pursue it again,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it moves even farther.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

647
00:52:52,335 --> 00:52:55,380
<font color="white">Do you still want to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">go down this thorny road?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

648
00:52:58,008 --> 00:53:01,219
<font color="white">If you had less than a month to live,</font><font color="white"></font>

649
00:53:01,720 --> 00:53:04,180
<font color="white">would you still want to play the piano?</font><font color="white"></font>

650
00:53:16,651 --> 00:53:17,485
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

651
00:53:18,153 --> 00:53:19,321
<font color="white">I would.</font><font color="white"></font>

652
00:53:20,739 --> 00:53:22,574
<font color="white">I know I don't have what it takes…</font><font color="white"></font>

653
00:53:24,993 --> 00:53:26,828
<font color="white">but I'm only happy when I play the piano.</font><font color="white"></font>

654
00:53:28,204 --> 00:53:29,122
<font color="white">Even if…</font><font color="white"></font>

655
00:53:30,624 --> 00:53:32,375
<font color="white"><i>Even if I only had one day left to live,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

656
00:53:33,919 --> 00:53:35,462
<font color="white"><i>I'd still want to play the piano.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

657
00:54:28,974 --> 00:54:30,517
<font color="white">Break the mold, Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

658
00:54:31,267 --> 00:54:33,812
<font color="white">Stop relying on that chunk of metal,</font><font color="white"></font>

659
00:54:33,895 --> 00:54:36,439
<font color="white">and find your own inner rhythm.</font><font color="white"></font>

660
00:54:41,111 --> 00:54:44,447
<font color="white">For a soloist,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">confidence is half the battle.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

661
00:54:45,281 --> 00:54:47,659
<font color="white">Command the stage with your energy.</font><font color="white"></font>

662
00:54:47,742 --> 00:54:48,994
<font color="white">If your energy is strong enough,</font><font color="white"></font>

663
00:54:49,786 --> 00:54:54,332
<font color="white">you can pull the conductor</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and the orchestra into your orbit.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

664
00:54:59,671 --> 00:55:00,755
<font color="white">Looking back,</font><font color="white"></font>

665
00:55:01,548 --> 00:55:04,551
<font color="white">I've realized that music</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that moves people's hearts</font><font color="white"></font></font>

666
00:55:04,634 --> 00:55:07,345
<font color="white">is one that carries a lifetime within it.</font><font color="white"></font>

667
00:55:08,722 --> 00:55:09,889
<font color="white">So…</font><font color="white"></font>

668
00:55:10,473 --> 00:55:13,143
<font color="white">you said you wanted to play</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">even if you only had one day to live.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

669
00:55:13,226 --> 00:55:15,061
<font color="white">Pour that resolve and your life</font><font color="white"></font>

670
00:55:17,355 --> 00:55:18,815
<font color="white">into your music.</font><font color="white"></font>

671
00:55:32,162 --> 00:55:33,246
<font color="white">Do you understand?</font><font color="white"></font>

672
00:55:52,307 --> 00:55:53,183
<font color="white">Mr. Choi.</font><font color="white"></font>

673
00:55:54,017 --> 00:55:55,310
<font color="white">Please say hello.</font><font color="white"></font>

674
00:55:55,393 --> 00:55:59,064
<font color="white">We managed to get Pianist Lee Min-sung</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for your premiere piece.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

675
00:55:59,647 --> 00:56:00,899
<font color="white">Hello.</font><font color="white"></font>

676
00:56:00,982 --> 00:56:02,609
<font color="white">It's an honor to meet you.</font><font color="white"></font>

677
00:56:02,692 --> 00:56:03,818
<font color="white">The honor is mine.</font><font color="white"></font>

678
00:56:03,902 --> 00:56:05,945
<font color="white">Thank you for agreeing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to play the concerto.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

679
00:56:06,029 --> 00:56:06,905
<font color="white">Please, sit.</font><font color="white"></font>

680
00:56:10,033 --> 00:56:12,786
<font color="white">There wasn't much time,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so I could only practice a little.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

681
00:56:13,411 --> 00:56:15,371
<font color="white">Shall I go ahead and play?</font><font color="white"></font>

682
00:56:15,455 --> 00:56:16,331
<font color="white">Yes, please.</font><font color="white"></font>

683
00:56:17,499 --> 00:56:18,666
<font color="white">It's all right.</font><font color="white"></font>

684
00:57:24,023 --> 00:57:25,567
<font color="white">This is that woman's photo.</font><font color="white"></font>

685
00:57:26,734 --> 00:57:27,569
<font color="white">And this…</font><font color="white"></font>

686
00:57:28,945 --> 00:57:29,821
<font color="white"><i>I'm sorry.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

687
00:57:31,489 --> 00:57:32,407
<font color="white"><i>You're right.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

688
00:57:33,741 --> 00:57:34,742
<font color="white"><i>It was me.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

689
00:57:35,326 --> 00:57:37,704
<font color="white"><i>It was the finals, and I hurt my finger.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

690
00:57:37,787 --> 00:57:39,080
<font color="white"><i>I couldn't think straight.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

691
00:57:39,914 --> 00:57:42,083
<font color="white"><i>I'd worked so hard to win the competition,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

692
00:57:42,167 --> 00:57:44,377
<font color="white"><i>but I was afraid I couldn't win</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>because of you.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

693
00:57:49,716 --> 00:57:50,717
<font color="white">COPYING FILES</font><font color="white"></font>

694
00:57:50,800 --> 00:57:53,178
<font color="white">KANG PI-O</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">KANG JI-HYE</font><font color="white"></font></font>

695
00:57:53,761 --> 00:57:56,764
<font color="white">Now we have the files we need</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to bury the two.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

696
00:57:58,057 --> 00:57:58,933
<font color="white">So?</font><font color="white"></font>

697
00:57:59,017 --> 00:58:00,602
<font color="white">You already broke him mentally,</font><font color="white"></font>

698
00:58:00,685 --> 00:58:02,228
<font color="white">so we just release it all at once, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

699
00:58:03,062 --> 00:58:03,897
<font color="white">Right?</font><font color="white"></font>

700
00:58:06,941 --> 00:58:08,526
<font color="white">Sure, let's do that.</font><font color="white"></font>

701
00:58:10,195 --> 00:58:11,696
<font color="white">I'll call you when it's time.</font><font color="white"></font>

702
00:58:13,531 --> 00:58:15,241
<font color="white">Okay then.</font><font color="white"></font>

703
00:58:15,950 --> 00:58:17,452
<font color="white">You're heading home now, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

704
00:58:32,133 --> 00:58:32,967
<font color="white">Good night!</font><font color="white"></font>

705
00:58:33,051 --> 00:58:34,302
<font color="white">Good night.</font><font color="white"></font>

706
00:59:01,037 --> 00:59:02,163
<font color="white">What are you doing here?</font><font color="white"></font>

707
00:59:08,836 --> 00:59:09,671
<font color="white">Choi Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

708
00:59:13,341 --> 00:59:14,676
<font color="white">Give me another chance.</font><font color="white"></font>

709
00:59:18,012 --> 00:59:18,930
<font color="white">The performance…</font><font color="white"></font>

710
00:59:20,848 --> 00:59:22,100
<font color="white">Let me do it.</font><font color="white"></font>

711
00:59:26,938 --> 00:59:28,189
<font color="white">Don't be ridiculous.</font><font color="white"></font>

712
00:59:31,776 --> 00:59:32,735
<font color="white">That piece.</font><font color="white"></font>

713
00:59:33,945 --> 00:59:35,738
<font color="white">You wrote it out of pure hatred for me.</font><font color="white"></font>

714
00:59:36,864 --> 00:59:37,824
<font color="white">Do you really think</font><font color="white"></font>

715
00:59:38,491 --> 00:59:40,451
<font color="white">anyone else can actually play it right?</font><font color="white"></font>

716
00:59:45,748 --> 00:59:47,166
<font color="white">Thanks, Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

717
00:59:48,167 --> 00:59:50,003
<font color="white">This experience made me realize my limits.</font><font color="white"></font>

718
00:59:50,086 --> 00:59:50,962
<font color="white">However,</font><font color="white"></font>

719
00:59:51,671 --> 00:59:53,047
<font color="white">when it comes to </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Nemesis</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

720
00:59:54,549 --> 00:59:57,051
<font color="white">I know no one else</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">can do that piece justice.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

721
01:00:00,305 --> 01:00:01,598
<font color="white">Will you throw this chance away</font><font color="white"></font>

722
01:00:02,849 --> 01:00:04,309
<font color="white">just for revenge?</font><font color="white"></font>

723
01:00:35,673 --> 01:00:37,800
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

724
01:00:37,884 --> 01:00:42,096
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Do you believe flawed artists</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>don't deserve to make art?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

725
01:00:42,180 --> 01:00:46,225
{\an8}<font color="white">Or do you believe in</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">separating the art from the artist?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

726
01:00:46,309 --> 01:00:49,062
{\an8}<font color="white">Are you trying to play judge,</font><font color="white"></font>

727
01:00:49,145 --> 01:00:50,772
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>or are you trying to be a musician?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

728
01:00:50,855 --> 01:00:54,692
{\an8}<font color="white">If only you had acknowledged him,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I wouldn't have done something this crazy!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

729
01:00:54,776 --> 01:00:55,610
{\an8}<font color="white">How could you do that?</font><font color="white"></font>

730
01:00:55,693 --> 01:00:58,154
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Why aren't you answering?</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>When do I release this?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

731
01:00:58,237 --> 01:00:59,822
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Only I get to mess with him.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

732
01:00:59,906 --> 01:01:01,616
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Just admit it.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

733
01:01:01,699 --> 01:01:04,035
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>The only person</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>who can do this piece justice</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

734
01:01:04,118 --> 01:01:05,328
{\an8}<font color="white">is me.</font><font color="white"></font>

735
01:01:06,329 --> 01:01:11,334
{\an8}<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim</font><font color="white"></font>
